        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq2KulCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAT00QAK8ndcgEqYdSX/VbOC6fLgDf\nW7LQ1HlXYSFTHsjci8XxLry85x4Nt2SmkZPuAnY8kJldpLThURjI2mKd7pitBjrB\nlc8bV8YjRduhbu78tQnkx8bbsQB2xKgmH4nHThsgKNO28D44vObTYXJY2aQHw1p5\nWBfNlYSpCIvIPLqbKnaIOKy70AUvwDzysA7eG2XSVLurgr5RatAw6xQVpE4pVKko\nnpgbrZHzeRWQsqLeET+9bF1ls9pQgkfRCB6V864QNv4Bk76iEYhoPas0sp+k5GZe\nszPIEz82nb9kE7xzDx3mOqL9L1xHHJBuzy03BP4y5Swm0MyJWjenI3LAo8Eb3jPB\nMYcgGQ56Hd7Ffp6ezLiaOptRIqMkuKh6raLnnthLsQt9Q26hDC2vLMtjeXG1VWUi\ndUPBtO1pmQ9s5/KWEYfBiYctu6DLfMeSyIKwdKKq1k1w4lmUIVueTHQuaamWJ8tg\nfIDqK/k1QEoYu/mYnyssGwtr+EjJ5WxOnmuuoQQk6aDOwyS+HYcMkbktgKTuYP+u\njrlv435GYxfJZ1ypo+Cig5CChxZ2pVJoSRPHza7aXUx3AOudhV195hBwS9nsXmdw\n0mz9JPUL/i1sX2Id/+XO1Fs8qHDRYj5SCxbpncqR1MH4Hy8aXDPum6tRrzcrl1JN\nPvJ/NYFPTdb32BNMu0JP\n=Wtu2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
        "payload": "tree 802b52464797f85378569cc26de342279d37f833\nparent 5821f7c9b0363a9b97a57fff3deaa4cd2da165a4\nauthor SaladDay <1203511142@qq.com> 1792584613 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1792584613 +0800\n\nfix(skills): don't wipe shared .builtin-skills; add @minimax-ai/code-acp launcher for ACP registry (#522)\n\n* fix(local-runtime): refresh only owned built-in skills in shared dir\n\nThe seed wiped the whole .builtin-skills dir on a fingerprint mismatch.\nThat dir is shared between the desktop app and the CLI/ACP agent, so a\nCLI start deleted desktop-only skills (mavis, create-agent, ...). Replace\nonly the dirs of skills this seed ships; per-skill rm failures (EPERM,\nEACCES) are logged and retried next start instead of aborting.\n\n* feat(acp): add @minimax-ai/code-acp launcher and lockstep publish job\n\n@minimax-ai/code ships two bins (mcode, mcode-tools), so the ACP\nregistry's `npx @minimax-ai/code acp` cannot pick one and the registry\nentry is stuck at 0.2.7. code-acp is a single-bin launcher that runs the\nmcode bin of a pinned @minimax-ai/code. The opt-in publish-acp job stamps\nand publishes it at the same version after @minimax-ai/code is on npm.",
